# v2 direct-coexistence accounting. The v1 front slopes are not used.
# Throughput of one 3328-water TIP4P/2005 slab (9984 atoms), LAMMPS
# 29 Aug 2024, OpenMP, cutoff 10 A, 2 fs, PPPM.
# threads  steps_per_s  ns_per_day
8  77.25  13.35
4  46.91  8.11
1  15.17  2.62
# Melt loop on the production binary, 4 threads: 10000 steps in 143.643 s
# = 69.6 steps/s = 12.0 ns/day.
# Lamas, Vega, Noya 2022 NaCl at 236 K used 1200 ns to reach equilibrium
# and averaged 500 ns. At 13.35 ns/day that average is 37 days on 8 threads,
# and the 1200 ns trajectory is 90 days.
# Five molalities times three seeds, even at 20 ns each, is
# 300 ns / 13.35 ns/day = 22 days on 8 threads.
# Crystal-density check, 512 ions, 8 ps, g/cm^3, block SE.
# Zeron, Abascal, Vega Table V: 2.050 g/cm^3.
crystal 2.0443 0.0008
